WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.080
(soft music)

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:03.180
- [Dasl] This tender moment
between North Korea leader

00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:05.790
Kim Jon Un and his daughter
stole the spotlight

00:00:05.790 --> 00:00:07.590
of a military parade in Pyongyang

00:00:07.590 --> 00:00:09.210
as the country showed off weapons,

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:12.630
it says are capable of
hitting the US mainland.

00:00:12.630 --> 00:00:14.700
And this was the fifth time since November

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:16.710
that the public has seen Kim Jong believed

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:18.810
to be the leader's second child.

00:00:18.810 --> 00:00:20.940
She's been seen holding
hands with her father

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.790
and being surrounded by
senior military officials.

00:00:23.790 --> 00:00:27.300
And her appearances have raised
questions about why she's

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:30.030
in the public eye now and
whether she could become

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:31.350
the next leader.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.990
We take a look at how
Kim Ju Ae is presented

00:00:33.990 --> 00:00:36.690
in North Korea propaganda
and her significance

00:00:36.690 --> 00:00:37.913
to the regime.

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:39.450
(soft music)

00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:44.450
So Kim Ju Ae first appeared
at an ICBM launch in November.

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:48.900
Kim Ju appeared with her father
holding hands and basically

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:51.630
surprising the world
because we had never seen

00:00:51.630 --> 00:00:53.992
one of the Kim children before.

00:00:53.992 --> 00:00:56.580
(cameras clicking)

00:00:56.580 --> 00:01:01.290
Since then, she has appeared
at multiple military events

00:01:01.290 --> 00:01:05.310
instead of appearing like they
are spending loads and loads

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:08.790
of money on military
equipment and missiles.

00:01:08.790 --> 00:01:11.700
Bringing the daughter to
these events helps portray

00:01:11.700 --> 00:01:14.302
Kim Jong Un as a father who is
trying to protect the nation

00:01:14.302 --> 00:01:16.833
with the weapons that they possess.

00:01:17.681 --> 00:01:20.730
Since North Korea first revealed

00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.130
that they had their nationwide outbreak,

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:25.980
North Korea is struggling economically

00:01:25.980 --> 00:01:29.416
and there have been restrictions to trade.

00:01:29.416 --> 00:01:32.070
(rocket launching)

00:01:32.070 --> 00:01:33.540
Despite all of that,

00:01:33.540 --> 00:01:37.860
we had a record number of
missile launches in 2022.

00:01:37.860 --> 00:01:41.070
Analysts say that they
need domestic support

00:01:41.070 --> 00:01:45.180
for many of the missile
launches that they're doing.

00:01:45.180 --> 00:01:47.730
She is a symbol of the next generation

00:01:47.730 --> 00:01:49.710
that the regime has to protect

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:51.761
with the weapons that they have.

00:01:51.761 --> 00:01:53.430
(upbeat music)

00:01:53.430 --> 00:01:56.490
So bringing Kim Ju to
these military events

00:01:56.490 --> 00:01:59.310
it not only helps soften
the image of the military

00:01:59.310 --> 00:02:03.360
it also portrays Kim Jong
Un as a loving father.

00:02:03.360 --> 00:02:05.275
Kim Jong Un does want to appeal

00:02:05.275 --> 00:02:10.275
to the public as a more generous
and a more caring figure.

00:02:11.490 --> 00:02:14.280
So ever since Kim Ju Ae appeared in public

00:02:14.280 --> 00:02:15.360
there has been a lot

00:02:15.360 --> 00:02:18.630
of talk about succession
plans in North Korea.

00:02:18.630 --> 00:02:21.540
So it's very significant to see how

00:02:21.540 --> 00:02:24.930
senior North Korean officials
will shake her hand,

00:02:24.930 --> 00:02:26.070
bow to her,

00:02:26.070 --> 00:02:27.780
be very respectful towards her

00:02:27.780 --> 00:02:31.920
despite her being a nine
to 10 year old child.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:34.500
But on the other hand, some analysts say

00:02:34.500 --> 00:02:36.570
that it might not be likely

00:02:36.570 --> 00:02:40.950
that a female becomes the
leader of North Korea.

00:02:40.950 --> 00:02:42.570
With North Korean leaders,

00:02:42.570 --> 00:02:44.580
there are these signs of portraying them

00:02:44.580 --> 00:02:47.760
as being very different
from ordinary people.

00:02:47.760 --> 00:02:48.900
And for now,

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:52.615
the way we've seen state media
portray Kim Ju Ae has been

00:02:52.615 --> 00:02:55.230
as a child, as a daughter,

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:59.250
as someone who Kim Jon
Un is trying to protect.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:02.370
Kim Jong Un is only
39-years-old, and analysts say

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:05.910
that it's still too early
for him to name a successor.

00:03:05.910 --> 00:03:06.840
Both his father

00:03:06.840 --> 00:03:08.940
and his grandfather
ruled until their deaths

00:03:08.940 --> 00:03:12.165
and it's likely that Kim Jong
Un is going to do the same.

00:03:12.165 --> 00:03:14.357
(soft music)

